cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the analysis software when using the code or reproducing the results."
type: software
title: "BurnPro3D prescribed-fire DOE analysis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yeshvantmatey/bp3d-prescribed-fire-doe"
license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a 1,600-run prescribed-fire simulation study using
  BurnPro3D and QUIC-Fire. The design of experiments (DOE) evaluates
  vegetation conditions, weather, and ignition layouts. The software
  reproduces statistical analyses and treatment-response figures from
  processed data tables.

